<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2003/02/13 (木) 23:11:32 <strong>▽</strong> <a href="mailto:mk8426@dosule.com">ｍｋ８４２６</a> </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs@res_200302134231132_log_starbow.cgi">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200302134231132"></font>
